DESCRIPTION:Play with the developers of Bump n' Bashǃ This event is planne
 d to happen every Monday Night‚ though it is not guaranteed. Feel free to
  bring your friends\; the more the merrierǃ What is Bump n' Bash? Bump n' 
 Bash is a game world that's a little bit platform fighter and a little bit 
 arena shooter: send your foes flying across soaring skies‚ erupting volca
 noes‚ and even deep space with a well-timed punchǃ The more damage you t
 ake‚ the higher you're launchedǃ What are the rules? 1. Be considerate o
 f others and mindful of how your words might affect them. 2. No racial‚ h
 omophobic‚ transphobic‚ ableist‚ or hateful slurs of any kind. 3. Res
 pect boundaries. "No" means no. 4. Keep soundboard usage to a minimum. One-
 off jokes can be funny‚ but spam is not. 5. Streaming/Recording is OK‚ 
 but notify others so they are aware. 6. Have fun‚ and take breaks if you 
 feel like you're getting heated. It's a party game‚ not a final examǃ 
 申し訳ありませんが、現在日本語を話せるスタッフがお
 りません.英語でコミュニケーションができ、翻訳のお
 手伝いにご興味がある方は、MintyMimixまでご連絡くださ
 い.
